            "text": "🚀 Looking at Southeast Asia as your next growth market but not sure where to start? Join us for an open AMA / Fireside Chat with Ellie Nguyen, Senior Analyst at Quest Ventures, one of Asia’s top venture capital firms.\n\nQuest Ventures has long partnered with Kazakhstan’s startup ecosystem, opening new opportunities for Astana Hub startups to scale into the fast-growing, mobile-first markets of Vietnam and Southeast Asia.\n\nWhy attend?\n• Learn the Vietnam expansion playbook from an active regional investor. \n• Understand how to stress-test your product in a hyper-competitive, mobile-first market. \n• Get an investor’s view on what makes a Kazakhstan startup export-ready for Asia. \n\n🇺🇸 The workshop will be held in English. \n\n📅 February 11, 5:00 PM\n📍Astana Hub, Mangilik El Ave. 55/7, C 3.5, Howard Lovecraft Hall\n🎟 Offline AMA / Fireside Chat\n\n👉 Register and secure your spot via the link in the profile header under the “Events” section!"
